Name of the genetically modified organism, the unique identifier in terms of the annex to the Regulation (EC) No 65/2004 of the European Commission of 14 January 2004
OJ L 10 of 16 January 2004, p. 5. Available from the FOEN, 3003 Bern. establishing a system for the development and assignment of unique identifiers for genetically modified organisms, if such an identifier exists, and an indication of the group to which the organism belongs, in accordance with Article 6 ContainO
SR 814.912;
